{"type": "concept", "subtype": "definition", "title": "ADHD 的两个组成部分", "content": "ADHD 分为两个部分：AD（attention disorder，注意力障碍）和 HD（多动障碍）。AD 部分指专注力无法集中，注意力敏感，人可能不一定动，但注意力不能集中；例如到十四五岁时注意力只有很短的时间。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["专注力"], "tags": ["ADHD", "注意力障碍", "多动障碍"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-0713043f1cc2-c001:a001", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-0713043f1cc2", "blocks": ["b00005"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-2", "relations": [{"target": "s-0713043f1cc2-c001:r003", "kind": "same_source_point", "condition": "Read both records and the shared source point; this is not a causal assertion.", "reason": "s-0713043f1cc2-c001:u0004", "evidence": "point_source_review"}, {"target": "legacy:zz-c-01", "kind": "complements", "condition": "旧原子限制：需排除多动症；a001补充ADHD构成及AD表征。", "reason": "a001补充了多动症排除的相关知识，有助于理解限制条件。", "evidence": "cross_library_review"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-0713043f1cc2-c001:u0004"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "concept", "subtype": "condition", "title": "AD 诊断的前提条件", "content": "判断孩子是否有 AD 前，必须先排除所有其他病理因素，例如身体疼痛等导致无法集中注意力的因素。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["专注力"], "tags": ["ADHD", "诊断", "排除因素"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-0713043f1cc2-c001:a002", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-0713043f1cc2", "blocks": ["b00006"], "source_kind": "A1"}, {"source_id": "s-0713043f1cc2", "blocks": ["b00006"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "alternate_titles": ["AD 诊断需排除病理因素"], "relations": [{"target": "s-0713043f1cc2-c001:a003", "kind": "prerequisite", "condition": "判断 AD 前必须先排除病理因素", "reason": "记录 a002 指出排除病理因素是诊断前提，a003 给出诊断标准，因此排除是应用标准的前提。", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis"}, {"target": "legacy:zz-c-11", "kind": "complements", "condition": "均涉及注意缺陷 AD 的判断前提；legacy 总体提到 ADHD，candidate 专讲 AD 前提。", "reason": "补充 AD 判断前需排除病理因素的前提。", "evidence": "cross_library_review"}, {"target": "legacy:zz-c-12", "kind": "equivalent", "condition": "均涉及 AD 诊断前排除其他病理因素；legacy 明确排除身体疼痛、家庭冲突，candidate 提到身体疼痛。", "reason": "两者都强调判断 AD 前必须排除其他病理因素。", "evidence": "cross_library_review"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-0713043f1cc2-c001:u0005"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded"}
{"type": "concept", "subtype": "condition", "title": "AD 诊断的年龄和持续时间标准", "content": "16 岁以内，症状需持续六个月以上才能开始判断；超过 16 岁，需有五个以上症状且至少持续六个月。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["专注力"], "tags": ["ADHD", "诊断标准", "年龄", "持续时间"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-0713043f1cc2-c001:a003", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-0713043f1cc2", "blocks": ["b00007", "b00008"], "source_kind": "A1"}, {"source_id": "s-0713043f1cc2", "blocks": ["b00007", "b00008"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [{"target": "s-0713043f1cc2-c001:a017", "kind": "supports", "condition": "年龄和持续时间标准与症状数量标准共同构成诊断标准", "reason": "a003 给出年龄和持续时间标准，a017 给出症状数量标准，两者共同用于诊断。", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis"}, {"target": "legacy:zz-c-12", "kind": "equivalent", "condition": "均涉及 AD 的年龄和持续时间标准；legacy 要求持续至少6个月，candidate 同样要求。", "reason": "两者都规定 16 岁以内持续六个月以上，16 岁以上五个症状以上且持续六个月，语义等价。", "evidence": "cross_library_review"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-0713043f1cc2-c001:u0007"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
